From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hans2294 <22217531+hans2294@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:38:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] amdgpu: Linux's amdgpu as a Haiku graphics driver

Builds the unchanged driver from ../linux-6.12 on linuxkpi, and publishes
/dev/dri/card0, renderD128 and a graphics node for app_server. Only probes the
GPUs on its device list (default Navi 31), and refuses kernels older than
hrev60102.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
